<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Espressif QFN104, 10.0 x 10.0 mm, 0.35 mm pitch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Peripheral lands are 0.19 x 0.65 mm, narrowed from the official Espressif KiCad footprint's 0.20 mm width for Adafruit 6/6 mil rules on 2026-09-07. The unchanged 0.35 mm pitch leaves 0.16 mm copper clearance. Pad centers and length follow revision dd76561812ab300351234ba6e0ec1295641796f0; this width is an Adafruit adaptation. The continuous 7.6 x 7.6 mm exposed copper pad uses a 3 x 3 reduced-paste window array derived from the official segmented-pad pattern.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mechanical source: ESP32-P4 Series Datasheet v0.7, Figure 6-1. Package body 10 x 10 mm, nominal height 0.85 mm, lead pitch 0.35 mm, exposed pad 7.5 mm nominal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Numbering is TOP VIEW per ESP32-P4 v0.7 pages 13 and 93: pin 1 upper-left, counterclockwise; pin 26 lower-left, 27 bottom-left, 52 bottom-right, 53 right-bottom, 78 right-top, 79 top-right, 104 top-left. Corrected bottom-view mirroring on 2026-09-13.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
