<package name="INDUCTOR_SUNLORD_MWSA0402S">
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sunlord MWSA0402S molded shielded power inductor&lt;/b&gt;, nominal body 4.4 x 4.2 mm, height 1.8 +/-0.2 mm.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manufacturer MWSA-S series catalog, revised 2022/10/12, PDF page 2: I = 1.5 mm land width, J = 2.2 mm inner gap, H = 2.5 mm land height. Lands are 1.5 x 2.5 mm at X = +/-1.85 mm, giving 3.7 mm center spacing and 5.2 mm outer span.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Non-polarized two-terminal component. P$1/P$2 are EAGLE logical pad identifiers, not a manufacturer polarity claim. This is not the SRP0415 land pattern.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
