<package name="HANBO_TF_027_H375">
<description>&lt;b&gt;HANBO TF-027-H375, 3.75 mm overall height.&lt;/b&gt; Adafruit 8mil-clearance adaptation of Rev A4 manufacturer lands: contacts 1-7 are 0.80 x 1.60, pin 8 is 0.60 x 1.60, all on 1.10 pitch; CD is 1.56 x 0.55. Pad centers are unchanged. Minimum internal copper clearance is 0.20925 mm including the MT3 taper. Reduced lands require sample solder/fit qualification; separate detect and three metal feet. Origin is connector X centerline / long right land Y center. MT3 uses an overlapping 0.80 x 4.00 SMD spine and a tapered copper polygon, NOT a full 1.80 x 4.00 rectangle. Explicit MT3 mask is expanded 0.10 mm; paste is 1:1. Layer 51 is the nominal 11.41 x 5.50 socket-body envelope; registration to land datum follows the drawing artwork (not a toleranced dimension). Layer 49 is the removable 11 x 15 card envelope, opening +Y, 9.70 mm protrusion. It is not a solid body or copper keepout. Card underside clearance and detect common/polarity are NOT specified; verify samples before release. MT1 is intentionally separate from SHIELD.</description>
